# Project intentions

Read [docs/INTENTIONS.md](docs/INTENTIONS.md) before expanding scope.

## Stay in v1/v2

Allowed: naive/mean/drift/seasonal naive, seasonal baseline, SES, Holt, optional production calendars (RU, default off), holdout evaluate, MAE/RMSE/MAPE, Gaussian prediction intervals.

Do **not** add without updating INTENTIONS first:

- ARIMA, Prophet, ML models
- Quantile, bootstrap, or conformal intervals
- Multivariate forecasts
- I/O or plotting (sibling `timeseries-grafana`)
- A forked Series type

## Optimize computation as you implement

Correctness first, then cost: one O(n) fit, O(1) work per horizon step, no nested scans. See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Use the timeseries module

Input and output are `timeseries.Series[float64]`. Use the public API only. Depend on a tagged `github.com/eduard-kolotushin/timeseries` version; do not add a `replace` directive.
